    "details": "<p><strong data-start=\"3\" data-end=\"23\">Overview</strong></p>\n<p>TCU HackDay by <strong data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"75\">Technical Community Universe</strong> is an 8-hour intensive build sprint that brings together student developers, designers, and founders to transform bold ideas into real, working products.</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1391\">Stay Connected:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1841\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1cktcxz\" data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1564\"><strong data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1418\">WhatsApp Community:</strong> Join the official group for instant updates, team building, and announcements:<br data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1500\" /><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/JNxOlF8mpYo4n6SVtUKWWS\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1564\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/IEOCAzzJ1GSEejHysCSxmj?mode=ems_copy_t</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"354\"> Event Format</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"436\">\n<li data-section-id=\"7omyog\" data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"371\">Mode: Offline</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pyg2dh\" data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"436\">Rounds: Online Qualifying Round + 8-Hour Final Hackathon</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"456\"> Eligibility</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"550\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1i724mw\" data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"521\">Who can participate: Student developers, designers &amp; founders</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"wb4u3l\" data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"550\">Team size: 2-4</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"568\">️ Timeline</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"679\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1pr5p6o\" data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"609\">Registrations Open: 1 October 2026</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1yswnf3\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"644\">Online Round: 10 January 2027</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"sq239g\" data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"679\">Grand Finale: 23 January 2027</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"704\">Rules &amp; Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"943\">\n<li data-section-id=\"j1rzs3\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"752\">Teams must build and ship a working product.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1o5lkdp\" data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"807\">The online round will serve as the qualifying round.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"25qznp\" data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"867\">Shortlisted teams will participate in the offline finale.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ixeu0c\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"943\">Further rules and submission guidelines will be shared by the organisers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"972\"> Hackathon Experience</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1116\">\n<li data-section-id=\"bmjnlx\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1002\">Innovation &amp; creativity</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1f7alvr\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1032\">️ Build a working product</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15mjyho\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1064\">Collaboration &amp; networking</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"cbtwex\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1087\">Industry exposure</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hxkfwl\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1116\">Mentorship and guidance</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Registration Details</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Free Registration</strong> - no entry fee</li>\n<li><strong>Required Info:</strong> Team name, member details, project idea summary</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1291\"> Venue (Offline)</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1370\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1xcn938\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1323\">Location: <strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1323\">TBA (Delhi NCR)</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jf4jen\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1370\">Format: <strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1370\">8-hour intensive build sprint</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jf4jen\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1370\">Facilities:<strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1370\"> High-speed Wi-Fi, food, power backup</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jf4jen\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1370\">Support<strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1370\">: Safety &amp; medical assistance available.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
